{"seq":9,"slug":"deep-learning","title":"深度学习","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning","rating":{"composite":4.17,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"深度学习-简介\">深度学习 简介</h1><p>深度学习是机器学习的核心分支，通过多层神经网络对数据进行层次化表征学习，已成为计算机视觉、自然语言处理、语音识别等领域的技术基石。本手册从神经网络的基本构件出发，逐步深入到卷积网络、序列模型、图神经网络等主流架构，并覆盖大规模训练工程实践和前沿架构探索，帮助读者建立系统且扎实的深度学习知识体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用读者\">适用读者</h2><p>本手册面向具备基础线性代数、概率论知识和一定编程经验的中级开发者与算法工程师。你不需要事先精通某个特定框架，但了解矩阵运算、梯度概念和 Python 编程基础会帮助你更高效地消化内容。对于已有一定深度学习经验的读者，图神经网络、大规模训练和架构前沿等章节同样能带来新的视角和实践思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><p>第1章<strong>神经网络基础</strong>从激活函数、反向传播、权重初始化和批归一化四个维度，为你打下坚实的网络训练基础。第2章<strong>卷积神经网络</strong>系统讲解卷积操作原理、经典架构演进、现代设计范式以及 Vision Transformer 的跨界融合。第3章<strong>序列模型</strong>涵盖 RNN 基础、LSTM 与 GRU 的门控机制、Seq2Seq 注意力机制以及时间卷积网络——这些是 Transformer 出现之前的经典路线；Mamba/SSM、FlashAttention、RoPE 等 2020s 中后期的现代序列范式不在本 hub 展开，入口见文末延伸阅读的路由节。第4章<strong>图神经网络</strong>介绍图数据表示、消息传递框架、主流 GNN 变体及其实际应用场景。第5章<strong>大规模训练</strong>聚焦优化算法、正则化技术、分布式训练和混合精度训练等工程关键技术。第6章<strong>架构前沿</strong>探讨生成式架构、自监督学习、神经架构搜索和高效网络设计——其中生成式架构与自监督学习已更新至 2025-2026 年图景（DiT/流匹配/一致性模型、DINOv3/SigLIP 2），神经架构搜索为历史脉络篇并附现状说明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 是深度学习的<strong>主干通识骨架</strong>：概念定义、原理推导与示例均在本文件内闭合，不依赖跳转即可完整阅读。它与同 category 的若干专题 hub 是分工关系而非重复，阅读时请按此定位校准深度预期：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想深入的专题</th>\n<th>去哪个兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>本 hub 对应位置只讲到</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图神经网络纵深</td>\n<td>41 · Graph Neural Networks</td>\n<td>第 4 章的入门脉络与经典变体，无进阶推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自监督/对比学习纵深</td>\n<td>44 · Self-Supervised &amp; Contrastive</td>\n<td>第 6 章的正典方法与动机，2025 进展仅速览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAS/AutoML 工程现状</td>\n<td>45 · NAS &amp; AutoML</td>\n<td>第 6 章的经典方法论 + 一节历史定位说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练优化工程实践</td>\n<td>53 · DL Training &amp; Optimization</td>\n<td>第 5 章的原理直觉，无调参与生产配方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vision Transformer 谱系</td>\n<td>83 · Vision Transformers Architectures</td>\n<td>第 2 章 ViT 融入 CNN 叙事的单篇视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>具体跳转链接集中在文末「延伸阅读」，正文章节保持自包含。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>建议按章节顺序循序渐进地阅读。前两章<strong>神经网络基础</strong>与<strong>卷积神经网络</strong>构成深度学习最核心的知识骨架，务必优先掌握。第三章<strong>序列模型</strong>和第四章<strong>图神经网络</strong>可根据你的业务方向选择性深入。第五章<strong>大规模训练</strong>是从实验到生产的关键桥梁，推荐所有工程导向的读者认真研读。第六章<strong>架构前沿</strong>适合在掌握基础后作为视野拓展来阅读。如果时间有限，优先完成神经网络基础、卷积神经网络和大规模训练三个章节，它们覆盖了深度学习最核心且实用的知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>按上文边界声明与现代范式的分工，下列兄弟 hub 提供按需深入的出口（均为可选探索，不影响本 hub 内容完整性）：</p>\n<p><strong>现代序列范式路由</strong>——第 3 章叙事止于 Transformer 之前，2020s 中后期成为主力的四类范式请按需跳转：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态空间模型与 Mamba（线性复杂度长序列建模）：<a href=\"../state-space-models-mamba/\">60 · State Space Models &amp; Mamba</a></li>\n<li>高效注意力机制（FlashAttention 等 IO 感知内核）：<a href=\"../efficient-attention-mechanisms/\">91 · Efficient Attention Mechanisms</a></li>\n<li>旋转位置编码 RoPE（现代 LLM 的默认位置方案）：<a href=\"../rotary-embeddings/\">99 · Rotary Embeddings</a></li>\n<li>混合专家 MoE（以稀疏激活换取容量）：<a href=\"../mixture-of-experts/\">57 · Mixture-of-Experts</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>本章专题的纵深出口</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扩散模型全景（DiT 骨干、流匹配训练实践）：<a href=\"../diffusion-models/\">40 · Diffusion Models</a></li>\n<li>采样器与少步蒸馏细节（求解器、LCM/Turbo 谱系）：<a href=\"../diffusion-sampling-solvers/\">87 · Diffusion Sampling Solvers</a></li>\n<li>自监督与对比学习纵深：<a href=\"../self-supervised-contrastive/\">44 · Self-Supervised &amp; Contrastive</a></li>\n<li>NAS/AutoML 工具链与近年进展：<a href=\"../neural-architecture-search-automl/\">45 · Neural Architecture Search &amp; AutoML</a></li>\n<li>训练优化工程实践：<a href=\"../dl-training-optimization/\">53 · DL Training &amp; Optimization</a></li>\n<li>Vision Transformer 家族谱系：<a href=\"../vision-transformers-architectures/\">83 · Vision Transformers Architectures</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-network-foundations","title":"神经网络基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"activation-functions","title":"激活函数与非线性变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/activation-functions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"backpropagation-deep-dive","title":"反向传播算法深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/backpropagation-deep-dive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"weight-initialization","title":"权重初始化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/weight-initialization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"batch-normalization","title":"批归一化与归一化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/batch-normalization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"convolutional-networks","title":"卷积神经网络","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"convolution-operations","title":"卷积操作原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/convolution-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-architectures","title":"经典 CNN 架构演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/classic-architectures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-cnn-designs","title":"现代 CNN 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/modern-cnn-designs"},{"seq":4,"slug":"vision-transformer","title":"Vision Transformer 视觉变换器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/vision-transformer"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequence-models","title":"序列模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rnn-fundamentals","title":"RNN 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/rnn-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lstm-and-gru","title":"LSTM 与 GRU 门控机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/lstm-and-gru"},{"seq":3,"slug":"seq2seq-attention","title":"Seq2Seq 与注意力机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/seq2seq-attention"},{"seq":4,"slug":"temporal-convolutions","title":"时间卷积网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/sequence-models/temporal-convolutions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-neural-networks","title":"图神经网络","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-representation","title":"图数据表示与编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/graph-representation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-passing","title":"消息传递框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/message-passing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gnn-variants","title":"GNN 主要变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/gnn-variants"},{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-applications","title":"图神经网络应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/graph-applications"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"training-at-scale","title":"大规模训练","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optimization-algorithms","title":"优化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/optimization-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regularization-techniques","title":"正则化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/regularization-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-training","title":"分布式训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/distributed-training"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mixed-precision","title":"混合精度训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/mixed-precision"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"architectures-and-trends","title":"架构前沿","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"generative-architectures","title":"生成式架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/generative-architectures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-supervised-learning","title":"自监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architec